WEBVTT

00:00.204 --> 00:03.074
Meet Anatono. Never miss a dose.

00:03.990 --> 00:06.540
Snap a prescription, and Gemma 4 reads it.

00:07.972 --> 00:10.122
Then plain code checks each one.

00:10.499 --> 00:12.889
Type how you take it, even in Roman Urdu.

00:13.262 --> 00:16.692
Gemma 4 understands it, and code sets the times.

00:17.083 --> 00:19.793
Calendar alarms ring, even with the app closed.

00:20.841 --> 00:23.391
Expired? Code says: don't take it.

00:24.537 --> 00:29.087
Open source, with an agent skill. Live at anatono.site.
